{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_004_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9543757bc6eac2736520213c3f5dcdd2b9a54a283f20ff1afa566d827f7fb9e6", "ja": "（今日は瑞希の、初めての握手会だ。ファンと直接\n触れ合える貴重な機会だけど、瑞希の様子はどうかな）", "zh": "（今天是瑞希第一次参加握手会。这是一次能与粉丝直接交流的宝贵机会，不过瑞希现在怎么样了呢）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_004_1001_littlemizuki", "source_sha256": "2ee1e9d53d35d43e2ffa7937280f0b5cde2a6aa471edd5514411dd77950338ca", "ja": "「違うわよ、瑞希！\nそこでハートのエースを見せるの！」", "zh": "「不对啦，瑞希！\n要在那里亮出红桃A！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_004_1002_044miz", "source_sha256": "9441cdc4ab56584645375561d9ae53d1dbe796da9987b92d007b43998ceae52a", "ja": "そうでした。ハートのエースで、\nみなさんのハートを掴む作戦でしたね……失敗失敗。", "zh": "对哦。是要用红桃A抓住大家的心来着……失败失败。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_004_1003_p", "source_sha256": "3e543e01998e999fc7dbb950fcdbd86eb2b89097d2b4c3406c7b45f31201d1da", "ja": "（ん？　誰かと話してるみたいだな。\nけど今日は、瑞希以外は誰もいないはず……）", "zh": "（嗯？好像在和谁说话。可是今天应该只有瑞希在才对……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_004_1004_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_004_1005_p", "source_sha256": "fbe03f4f82b7311d50fe1cba20df9bd5b0618e291a02da2be036237f5476deec", "ja": "お疲れさま、瑞希。\n……あれ？　瑞希しかいないな。", "zh": "辛苦了，瑞希。\n……咦？这里只有瑞希一个人啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_004_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "caccf3ac16adb8c4c5d397dda38ef122ec6937be98436f2d77d7bff5d7626545", "ja": "{$P$}、ちょうどいいところに。\n……突然ですが、ここに1枚のコインがあります。", "zh": "{$P$}，你来得正好。\n……虽然有些突然，不过这里有1枚硬币。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_004_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "6bd2f96641c079ad8cb612da646004eb3f4a67b338fe4ee644e61458729dd53a", "ja": "私が今から、このコインを消してみせます。\nそれでは。……ワン、ツー……スリー。", "zh": "我现在要让这枚硬币消失给你看。\n那么。……一、二……三。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_004_1008_p", "source_sha256": "ed072a957c9770988b788fdeaec5d96a5e5520ac4d0890b11ef4a96d5c69fb7e", "ja": "あっ、コインが消えた……？\nいったいどこに……。", "zh": "啊，硬币消失了……？\n到底去哪儿了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_004_1009_044miz", "source_sha256": "525f95fd132a3227815468ae875a521e25281068aa9d2155ccadca430b2366ae", "ja": "{$P$}。\nスーツのポケットを見てください。", "zh": "{$P$}。\n请看看西装的口袋。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_004_1010_p", "source_sha256": "4e4a118ef2281d6d7617d29a3cd996f188d907c9458c28c68061d2233df13d00", "ja": "ポケットの中にコインが！\nいつの間に……？", "zh": "口袋里居然有枚硬币！\n什么时候放进去的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_004_1011_littlemizuki", "source_sha256": "a205aa07cb8d2f36b880ca7fe786791dc9374590eca33f3587250739aa454169", "ja": "「驚いた！？　そのコイン、私が入れたのよ！」", "zh": "「吓了一跳吧！？那枚硬币，是我投进去的哦！」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_004_1012_p", "source_sha256": "e5dcf1de834c0a7c00575e0abc6662fae29684c94c8a4a6dc374e90913fcd25a", "ja": "今のは……その人形が喋ったのか？\nじゃあ、外に聞こえていたのは腹話じゅ……。", "zh": "刚才那是……那个玩偶在说话吗？\n那么，外面听到的就是腹语……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_004_1013_044miz", "source_sha256": "532805a76e51ac128cc5d0aebb458a017bff876fb323516e338b97b2b228c219", "ja": "{$P$}。\nこの子は、人形ではありません。リトルミズキです。", "zh": "{$P$}。\n这孩子不是人偶，而是小瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_004_1014_littlemizuki", "source_sha256": "c562d846eb498a6552f9a9ff4c6e4caa5c1b71f9e954574bcc2c6fc2ee4339e2", "ja": "「アシスタントのリトルミズキよ！\n今日はよろしくね、{$P$}！」", "zh": "我是助理小瑞希！\n今天请多关照，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_004_1015_p", "source_sha256": "58a647d049c0804af6327cba4d6d210a484a0582781b583f2c485651d52dc09b", "ja": "そ、そうか。\n……よろしくな、リトルミズキ。", "zh": "这、这样啊。\n……今天就拜托你了，小瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_004_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "548b1b6245c1adc643cc2bd02c9a4bec9bbff9bf9d49598d4df86cf6263ebdff", "ja": "というわけで。今日は私たちふたりで、\n握手会を盛り上げようと思います。", "zh": "所以说，今天就由我们两个人，\n来让握手会热闹起来吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_004_1017_p", "source_sha256": "498f160376989ce8d7641c0207c1b9654f409898f55bc5900264eb4d0d05c687", "ja": "えっ？　もしかして、握手会で\nお客さんに手品を見せるつもりなのか？", "zh": "咦？难道你们打算在握手会上给客人表演魔术吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_004_1018_044miz", "source_sha256": "9ebe35a948aea64ef9a500c451a81e1a9477928e8e25957fc3a2c3dc39030cb1", "ja": "はい。そのつもりで、練習を。\n……ダメ、でしょうか？", "zh": "是的，我正打算练习这个。\n……不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_004_1019_p", "source_sha256": "aaf8160ce1fb4a404aea96d26e4652fabe086964af62db5ba1c13064d2113467", "ja": "ダメというか……流石に、来てくれた人全員には\n時間的に厳しいな。予定時間があるし……。", "zh": "与其说是不行……要给来的人全都安排上，时间上确实有点困难。毕竟还有预定时间……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_004_1020_044miz", "source_sha256": "6d1cba119c5f2c9fd02e58a6aeed14cf1765eccc776fe58c2c4d97ed8793523f", "ja": "そうですか。いいアイディアだと思ったのですが。\n……しゅん。", "zh": "这样啊。我还以为这是个不错的主意呢。\n……失落。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_004_1021_p", "source_sha256": "0a6318ab7f8aabc143e9194a00d1e3e7d72906eae2908b8ae9c056a55724b336", "ja": "残念だけど……。ところで、瑞希はどうして\n手品を見せようと思ったんだ？", "zh": "虽然很遗憾……话说回来，瑞希为什么会想给大家表演魔术呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_004_1022_044miz", "source_sha256": "d989b986bdc4880b7cbffc34f5ebe934f8439d0b5c9ce9b7fa12705919076cfd", "ja": "はい。……それは、\n手品を見ると、人は、笑顔になるからです。", "zh": "是的。……因为，\n看到魔术，人就会露出笑容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_004_1023_044miz", "source_sha256": "06a1283f710bde3f708c346d66c7ff60c7f5fa1e128ccfcba103697313a1f0d2", "ja": "私が手品をすると、周りの大人たちはよろこびます。\n学校の友達とも、仲良くなれました。", "zh": "每当我变魔术，周围的大人们都会很高兴。\n和学校里的朋友们，也因此变得亲近了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_004_1024_044miz", "source_sha256": "7df0ded3b2b2e59250c161387617d0fd981d2cf8605c1eae467f2f2f9a408516", "ja": "今日は、私にとって初めての握手会です。\n来てくれた人に、笑顔になってほしいので。", "zh": "今天是我第一次参加握手会。\n因为我希望前来的人都能露出笑容。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_004_1025_p", "source_sha256": "8e7cc1eb1d0a6d71008d71b7a59f2c24d8030278a6f87a1d2d29633911e2458f", "ja": "なるほど……そういう事か。", "zh": "原来如此……是这么回事啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_004_1026_044miz", "source_sha256": "f6db7696457e4d418fd6acf274c30c3d3880572f170eeda600285ac050db5a33", "ja": "けど、手品ができないとなると……私のトークで、\n来てくれた人を楽しませることができるでしょうか。", "zh": "可是，如果不会变魔术的话……光靠我的谈话，真的能让来参加的人开心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_004_1027_p", "source_sha256": "8798882791541681a05e0ac6ec7b4ef0e65e602d2ebad53d8fc280f708400797", "ja": "トークもいいけど……\n瑞希、ひとつ大事な事を忘れてないか？", "zh": "聊天也不错，不过……\n瑞希，你是不是忘了一件重要的事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_004_1028_p", "source_sha256": "cd949bfdc272c5f676f5a2c66beec21f08159dc8da5d5183612c288445868573", "ja": "握手会に来てくれているお客さんは、\n瑞希の手品が目当てなわけじゃないぞ。", "zh": "来参加握手会的客人，可不是冲着瑞希的魔术来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_004_1029_044miz", "source_sha256": "bdf6108b491e8f7a75c8e789e53ab15aecb17371e7b63aa7f6f4269cf6c10d7a", "ja": "はっ。……たしかに、そうでした。\n今日来てくれる人の目当ては……握手。", "zh": "啊。……确实，是这样。\n今天来的人，想要的是……握手。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_004_1030_044miz", "source_sha256": "6ca38e276137bde7baa118c29b1d1e1d675e7598328d9dc110203df2b83d4fbc", "ja": "わかりました。手品は、いったん封印します。\nその代わり、私の思いを両手にこめます。……ぎゅ。", "zh": "明白了。魔术就先封印起来。\n作为代替，我会把自己的心意注入双手。……紧紧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_004_1031_p", "source_sha256": "4a1d8140e1469edc6ec1961ffba42553e525e5f27f6cf4d616b6cb44afb0cb05", "ja": "うん、その意気だ！\nそろそろ時間だな……！", "zh": "嗯，就是这个干劲！\n差不多到时间了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_004_1032_044miz", "source_sha256": "6d37b8be98446b849521fe11fd3c4ec07010261412fe4b5dc1f2019968824c9a", "ja": "はい。いってきます。", "zh": "好的。我出发了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_004_1033_p", "source_sha256": "5c986c918afff3254d276eb8c07e0704a720adfcefd059ecc8f41827269f8aeb", "ja": "（瑞希と握手したお客さんが、たちまち笑顔になる。\n瑞希は時間を目いっぱい使って、握手会を終えた）", "zh": "（和瑞希握手的客人立刻露出了笑容。\n瑞希充分利用时间，结束了握手会。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_004_1034_044miz", "source_sha256": "28194a73208a664c66ec3c1a5ca05a1bb1a5be2d0c9839d825198e43112895ec", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさまです。", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_004_1035_p", "source_sha256": "2cec8f8498aacab51c55d31ab531dc945bbeb25ca400ac45b3a927594fed028f", "ja": "お疲れさま、瑞希。\nどうだった？　初めての握手会の感想は。", "zh": "辛苦了，瑞希。\n怎么样？第一次参加握手会，有什么感想？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_004_1036_044miz", "source_sha256": "8dd5e2a47141032942cc33a3633630ec25a192b2f0ee4816d513d99ae5c0aac5", "ja": "はい。みなさん、「本物の瑞希ちゃんだ」と、\nよろこんでくれました。かわいい、とも。……ポッ。", "zh": "是的。大家都很高兴地说：“这就是真正的瑞希。”还说很可爱。……脸红了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_004_1037_044miz", "source_sha256": "e635024a54e18a41ea0c0789bca84ad34247382782c33d7620964e8b45f984a4", "ja": "こんなに一度に、大勢の人に褒められたのは、\n生まれて初めてです。……胸が、ドキドキ。", "zh": "像这样一次被这么多人夸奖，还是出生以来第一次……心里怦怦直跳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_004_1038_044miz", "source_sha256": "304effab136436f5a031638c6f6d3f2d8ef8a64421e5999d79b5b9d79dbd0f67", "ja": "ひとりひとりは、短い時間でしたが。握手を通して、\nみなさんの気持ちが伝わってくる気がしました。", "zh": "虽然和每个人相处的时间都很短，但通过握手，我感觉大家的心意传达给我了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_004_1039_044miz", "source_sha256": "1f334f78263352df3e240aefe7aaadbc62c9d3926f152b9796082abef92b63fa", "ja": "握手をすると、ファンの人たちが笑顔になって。\n……その笑顔に、また、元気をもらった気がします。", "zh": "握手之后，粉丝们都露出了笑容。\n……看到那样的笑脸，我感觉自己也再次获得了力量。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_004_1040_044miz", "source_sha256": "b9f0b33b6e15ba538cf6486ca6f4eedc27fd89261904b812fbbd33c3c9c5de34", "ja": "……アイドルって、すごいな。", "zh": "……偶像，真的好厉害。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_004_1041_p", "source_sha256": "485dd70cd8aaa7cf126aa24c7ac3078b5d56a5e7b5339cd4521bc4b5be7c629e", "ja": "そう思えたのは、瑞希がファンの人達と、\nしっかり向き合ったからだと思うよ。", "zh": "我觉得，正是因为瑞希认真地面对了粉丝们，才会有这样的感受。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_004_1042_p", "source_sha256": "52f6af732b48500b91370390ccc0587f7c3801e2a53aaebd631e01be0c3c0556", "ja": "もらった元気は、色んな形でファンの人達に返して\nいこう。これからも、アイドル活動頑張ろうな！", "zh": "把收到的活力，以各种方式回馈给粉丝们吧。今后也一起努力进行偶像活动吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_004_1043_044miz", "source_sha256": "784d35a15b60b2bf7ce9e3fcf52d0add26fe56f6b71f78453cd0f56c8b69182f", "ja": "はい、{$P$}。がんばります。\n……いつか手品も、みんなに見せてあげたいな。", "zh": "好的，{$P$}。我会努力的。\n……总有一天，也想把魔术表演给大家看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_004_1044_p", "source_sha256": "727ffab119d901b1021255244f0dfb37a5ca40183da1223901cb9a2912005052", "ja": "（瑞希の、ファンの人を楽しませたいという気持ちは、\nアイドルとして大切なものだ）", "zh": "（想让粉丝们开心的这份心情，对偶像来说是非常重要的。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_044miz_004_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_044miz_004_1045_p", "source_sha256": "6ff53d433071d27f2762bbd1857bf441301a8b4401651126569af967e45371a3", "ja": "（得意の手品を披露する機会は、そう遠くないはずだ）", "zh": "（展示她拿手的魔术的机会，应该很快就会到来了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
